{"$schema": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/guitaripod/wwdc-sessions/master/schema/transcript.schema.json", "id": "wwdc2019-430", "language": "eng", "source": "https://developer.apple.com/videos/play/wwdc2019/430", "wordCount": 2073, "segments": [{"start": 13.0, "text": "This year, our Create ML"}, {"start": 15.0, "text": "release has new models and a"}, {"start": 17.0, "text": "whole new workflow."}, {"start": 19.0, "text": "Every workflow starts with"}, {"start": 21.0, "text": "input."}, {"start": 22.0, "text": "The devices that we develop for,"}, {"start": 24.0, "text": "use, and love, are rich with"}, {"start": 26.0, "text": "information from different"}, {"start": 27.0, "text": "sensors such as a camera, the"}, {"start": 29.0, "text": "microphone, the keyboard,"}, {"start": 31.0, "text": "Accelerometer, even Gyroscope."}, {"start": 34.0, "text": "And all of these types of input"}, {"start": 35.0, "text": "can be used so you can train"}, {"start": 37.0, "text": "machine learning models and make"}, {"start": 38.0, "text": "your apps more personalized and"}, {"start": 40.0, "text": "more intelligent."}, {"start": 42.0, "text": "Last year, we supported three of"}, {"start": 44.0, "text": "these types of input; images,"}, {"start": 47.0, "text": "text, and tabular data."}, {"start": 50.0, "text": "This year, we're increasing the"}, {"start": 51.0, "text": "set of available domains from"}, {"start": 53.0, "text": "three to five."}, {"start": 54.0, "text": "And now, introducing Activity"}, {"start": 57.0, "text": "and Sound."}, {"start": 58.0, "text": "We're also expanding the breadth"}, {"start": 60.0, "text": "of available models within all"}, {"start": 62.0, "text": "of them."}, {"start": 63.0, "text": "And all of this is being brought"}, {"start": 65.0, "text": "into a new medium."}, {"start": 67.0, "text": "We call it Create ML app."}, {"start": 70.0, "text": "It all starts with identifying"}, {"start": 72.0, "text": "your domain."}, {"start": 74.0, "text": "And once you filter by your"}, {"start": 75.0, "text": "input, you can see all of the"}, {"start": 76.0, "text": "available model types you can"}, {"start": 78.0, "text": "create."}, {"start": 80.0, "text": "Create ML then breaks down the"}, {"start": 82.0, "text": "task of creating machine"}, {"start": 83.0, "text": "learning model into three simple"}, {"start": 85.0, "text": "phases; input, training, and"}, {"start": 89.0, "text": "output."}, {"start": 90.0, "text": "This new environment changes the"}, {"start": 92.0, "text": "way you interact with machine"}, {"start": 93.0, "text": "learning on the system."}, {"start": 95.0, "text": "The app then displays an"}, {"start": 97.0, "text": "overview of your data and a rich"}, {"start": 99.0, "text": "set of analytics as it trains."}, {"start": 102.0, "text": "You can visualize your model's"}, {"start": 103.0, "text": "progress in an easy to"}, {"start": 104.0, "text": "understand graphical view that"}, {"start": 106.0, "text": "displays the accuracy of your"}, {"start": 107.0, "text": "model across iterations."}, {"start": 109.0, "text": "You can also see a breakdown of"}, {"start": 112.0, "text": "the precision and recall values"}, {"start": 113.0, "text": "for each class your model was"}, {"start": 115.0, "text": "trained on."}, {"start": 116.0, "text": "And the table is interactive so"}, {"start": 118.0, "text": "you can filter by class or by"}, {"start": 120.0, "text": "percentage to better understand"}, {"start": 122.0, "text": "your model's performance."}, {"start": 124.0, "text": "The process of testing is as"}, {"start": 127.0, "text": "simple as dragging and dropping"}, {"start": 128.0, "text": "in new data."}, {"start": 130.0, "text": "You can have the ability to"}, {"start": 131.0, "text": "train and retest just by"}, {"start": 133.0, "text": "clicking the Test button."}, {"start": 136.0, "text": "And what's really unique about"}, {"start": 137.0, "text": "Create ML is you can easily"}, {"start": 138.0, "text": "preview trained models in the"}, {"start": 140.0, "text": "Output tab."}, {"start": 141.0, "text": "This new feature allows you to"}, {"start": 143.0, "text": "see exactly how your model will"}, {"start": 144.0, "text": "predict without having to"}, {"start": 146.0, "text": "incorporate your models into"}, {"start": 147.0, "text": "your apps."}, {"start": 149.0, "text": "This means no more waiting to"}, {"start": 150.0, "text": "deploy them."}, {"start": 151.0, "text": "You can do this directly in"}, {"start": 153.0, "text": "Create ML, saving you time to"}, {"start": 154.0, "text": "perfect your models instead."}, {"start": 156.0, "text": "The Preview section is also"}, {"start": 159.0, "text": "custom built for every template,"}, {"start": 161.0, "text": "ensuring a complete end-to-end"}, {"start": 163.0, "text": "experience for every task."}, {"start": 166.0, "text": "But what better way to see this"}, {"start": 167.0, "text": "than to show it to you live?"}, {"start": 171.0, "text": "Let's take a look."}, {"start": 178.0, "text": "Now, over in Xcode, I've been"}, {"start": 179.0, "text": "working on a flower classifier"}, {"start": 181.0, "text": "app to help me identify"}, {"start": 182.0, "text": "different types of flowers."}, {"start": 185.0, "text": "And I've been using a model that"}, {"start": 186.0, "text": "I downloaded from the Model"}, {"start": 187.0, "text": "Gallery called Resnet50."}, {"start": 190.0, "text": "And this is a well-known image"}, {"start": 191.0, "text": "classifier model that's been"}, {"start": 193.0, "text": "trained to recognize 1,000"}, {"start": 194.0, "text": "different classes."}, {"start": 196.0, "text": "But this model is taking up"}, {"start": 198.0, "text": "about 100 megabytes of my app."}, {"start": 200.0, "text": "And we can see when I actually"}, {"start": 202.0, "text": "try it on different images it"}, {"start": 205.0, "text": "knows that this Hibiscus is a"}, {"start": 207.0, "text": "flower, but it doesn't know the"}, {"start": 209.0, "text": "exact type."}, {"start": 210.0, "text": "So, it doesn't quite suit my"}, {"start": 213.0, "text": "needs. Now, what I can do is from Xcode"}, {"start": 217.0, "text": "I can open Developer Tools and"}, {"start": 219.0, "text": "launch Create ML."}, {"start": 222.0, "text": "This then prompts me to create a"}, {"start": 224.0, "text": "new document."}, {"start": 225.0, "text": "And we can see I'm launched into"}, {"start": 228.0, "text": "the Template View where I can"}, {"start": 230.0, "text": "see all the available models we"}, {"start": 233.0, "text": "can create."}, {"start": 234.0, "text": "Since I'm working with images,"}, {"start": 235.0, "text": "I'll filter by image and select"}, {"start": 237.0, "text": "the Image Classifier."}, {"start": 240.0, "text": "We can then name this."}, {"start": 245.0, "text": "And then, pick the place to save"}, {"start": 247.0, "text": "it so we can come back to it"}, {"start": 248.0, "text": "later."}, {"start": 249.0, "text": "And then, launch into the New"}, {"start": 252.0, "text": "App view."}, {"start": 254.0, "text": "And you can see that I'm, I'm"}, {"start": 256.0, "text": "first prompted to drag in input"}, {"start": 258.0, "text": "as training data."}, {"start": 259.0, "text": "And if I progress through some"}, {"start": 261.0, "text": "of the other tabs, they're not"}, {"start": 262.0, "text": "unlocked yet because I haven't"}, {"start": 264.0, "text": "gone through the flow."}, {"start": 266.0, "text": "So, let's try this sequentially."}, {"start": 268.0, "text": "On my desktop, I set aside some"}, {"start": 271.0, "text": "images of different types of"}, {"start": 273.0, "text": "flowers."}, {"start": 274.0, "text": "And you can see, I have some"}, {"start": 276.0, "text": "hibiscus, some passionflower,"}, {"start": 280.0, "text": "and then even some roses,"}, {"start": 285.0, "text": "dahlias, and daisies."}, {"start": 287.0, "text": "I could take this folder and"}, {"start": 288.0, "text": "drag it in and immediately see"}, {"start": 291.0, "text": "that I have 65 different images"}, {"start": 293.0, "text": "contained within it and they're"}, {"start": 294.0, "text": "across five different classes."}, {"start": 299.0, "text": "Now, since we have our input"}, {"start": 301.0, "text": "data, I can hit the Run button"}, {"start": 303.0, "text": "and automatically this model"}, {"start": 304.0, "text": "begins training."}, {"start": 306.0, "text": "It first starts by extracting"}, {"start": 307.0, "text": "features from the images."}, {"start": 309.0, "text": "And then, we can see the"}, {"start": 310.0, "text": "progress as training begins."}, {"start": 313.0, "text": "I can see a breakdown of how the"}, {"start": 315.0, "text": "model's performing on this data."}, {"start": 317.0, "text": "But what I'd really like to do"}, {"start": 318.0, "text": "is see how the model performs on"}, {"start": 320.0, "text": "new data that it hasn't seen."}, {"start": 322.0, "text": "So, I'll navigate to the Testing"}, {"start": 323.0, "text": "tab and I'll drag in these new"}, {"start": 325.0, "text": "flowers that I've set aside and"}, {"start": 328.0, "text": "hit Test."}, {"start": 334.0, "text": "Now, what I'd really like to do"}, {"start": 335.0, "text": "is take a look at the trained"}, {"start": 336.0, "text": "model in the Output tab."}, {"start": 338.0, "text": "And we can see here I have a"}, {"start": 340.0, "text": "flower classifier that's 66"}, {"start": 343.0, "text": "kilobytes."}, {"start": 344.0, "text": "Now, to actually preview this,"}, {"start": 347.0, "text": "I've taken some other photos and"}, {"start": 349.0, "text": "perhaps this hibiscus that"}, {"start": 350.0, "text": "wasn't working before with"}, {"start": 352.0, "text": "Resnet."}, {"start": 353.0, "text": "And I can see now, this model"}, {"start": 355.0, "text": "can correctly predict exactly"}, {"start": 357.0, "text": "what it is."}, {"start": 358.0, "text": "And I can see other predictions"}, {"start": 359.0, "text": "the model has made and"}, {"start": 360.0, "text": "confidence values for each one."}, {"start": 362.0, "text": "I can even take a full folder"}, {"start": 365.0, "text": "and drag them in and debug any"}, {"start": 369.0, "text": "image that this model has"}, {"start": 370.0, "text": "predicted on."}, {"start": 372.0, "text": "Now, once I'm satisfied, I can"}, {"start": 373.0, "text": "take this model and drag it out."}, {"start": 380.0, "text": "And then, reintegrate that into"}, {"start": 381.0, "text": "my app."}, {"start": 383.0, "text": "But what's more, is you can also"}, {"start": 384.0, "text": "leverage the power of Continuity"}, {"start": 386.0, "text": "Camera in Create ML."}, {"start": 389.0, "text": "And from this, what I can do is"}, {"start": 391.0, "text": "I can import from my phone which"}, {"start": 393.0, "text": "is attached."}, {"start": 394.0, "text": "And I can try to take a photo of"}, {"start": 397.0, "text": "this flower that I have here on"}, {"start": 399.0, "text": "stage, and we can see how it"}, {"start": 401.0, "text": "does."}, {"start": 402.0, "text": "And it actually turns out okay."}, {"start": 413.0, "text": "Now, if you're not happy with"}, {"start": 414.0, "text": "your performance or if you'd"}, {"start": 415.0, "text": "just like to run some more"}, {"start": 416.0, "text": "experiments, there's a Plus"}, {"start": 418.0, "text": "button here, as well."}, {"start": 419.0, "text": "And what you can do is you can"}, {"start": 420.0, "text": "select more training data."}, {"start": 423.0, "text": "You can toggle how our"}, {"start": 424.0, "text": "validation data is specified and"}, {"start": 426.0, "text": "even your testing data, as well."}, {"start": 430.0, "text": "This time, I might want to tweak"}, {"start": 431.0, "text": "some augmentations."}, {"start": 433.0, "text": "And then, I can hit Run to"}, {"start": 434.0, "text": "train."}, {"start": 436.0, "text": "And that's a look at the new"}, {"start": 437.0, "text": "workflow in Create ML."}, {"start": 440.0, "text": "Let's go back to the slides."}, {"start": 445.0, "text": "So, you've seen Create ML gives"}, {"start": 447.0, "text": "you a whole new way to train"}, {"start": 449.0, "text": "your custom machine learning"}, {"start": 450.0, "text": "models on the Mac, with a"}, {"start": 452.0, "text": "beautiful look and feel."}, {"start": 454.0, "text": "And with additions like metrics"}, {"start": 455.0, "text": "visualization, live progress,"}, {"start": 457.0, "text": "and interactive preview, Create"}, {"start": 460.0, "text": "ML app sets the bar for a great"}, {"start": 462.0, "text": "model training experience."}, {"start": 465.0, "text": "In the demo, we walked through"}, {"start": 466.0, "text": "just one model that you can"}, {"start": 468.0, "text": "create with Create ML."}, {"start": 470.0, "text": "But this release, we're"}, {"start": 471.0, "text": "introducing nine."}, {"start": 473.0, "text": "So, let's take a high-level tour"}, {"start": 474.0, "text": "of all of the models you can"}, {"start": 476.0, "text": "create and some examples of"}, {"start": 478.0, "text": "sample apps."}, {"start": 480.0, "text": "Starting with the image domain,"}, {"start": 482.0, "text": "we have the Image Classifier and"}, {"start": 484.0, "text": "Object Detector."}, {"start": 486.0, "text": "An Image Classifier can be used"}, {"start": 488.0, "text": "for categorizing images based on"}, {"start": 490.0, "text": "their contents."}, {"start": 491.0, "text": "For example, the Art Style"}, {"start": 492.0, "text": "identifier uses a custom Image"}, {"start": 494.0, "text": "Classifier to determine the most"}, {"start": 496.0, "text": "likely movement of a piece."}, {"start": 498.0, "text": "It then separately provides an"}, {"start": 500.0, "text": "overview of notable artists to"}, {"start": 502.0, "text": "complete the app experience."}, {"start": 506.0, "text": "In Create ML, the Image"}, {"start": 507.0, "text": "Classifier leverages core Apple"}, {"start": 509.0, "text": "technology by performing"}, {"start": 511.0, "text": "transfer learning on top of the"}, {"start": 512.0, "text": "vision feature print model"}, {"start": 514.0, "text": "already in the OS."}, {"start": 516.0, "text": "This allows you to benefit from"}, {"start": 517.0, "text": "faster training times and a"}, {"start": 519.0, "text": "reduced model size in your app."}, {"start": 523.0, "text": "Also, you have the option to"}, {"start": 524.0, "text": "train with augmentation to make"}, {"start": 526.0, "text": "your models more robust to"}, {"start": 528.0, "text": "unseen input."}, {"start": 530.0, "text": "If you instead want to identify"}, {"start": 532.0, "text": "multiple objects within an image"}, {"start": 533.0, "text": "instead of one single one, you"}, {"start": 535.0, "text": "might want to create an Object"}, {"start": 537.0, "text": "Detector."}, {"start": 538.0, "text": "Object Detectors can be used for"}, {"start": 540.0, "text": "localizing and recognizing"}, {"start": 542.0, "text": "contents within an image."}, {"start": 544.0, "text": "For example, these can be"}, {"start": 546.0, "text": "trained to detect one or more"}, {"start": 547.0, "text": "classes such as specific playing"}, {"start": 550.0, "text": "cards or the exact suits"}, {"start": 552.0, "text": "contained on them."}, {"start": 554.0, "text": "The Object Detector is a deep"}, {"start": 556.0, "text": "learning-based model and"}, {"start": 557.0, "text": "performs data augmentation to"}, {"start": 559.0, "text": "make it more robust."}, {"start": 561.0, "text": "And it does this entirely on"}, {"start": 563.0, "text": "your Mac's GPU."}, {"start": 566.0, "text": "Our next domain is Sound."}, {"start": 569.0, "text": "Within Sound, we have a new"}, {"start": 570.0, "text": "model called the Sound"}, {"start": 571.0, "text": "Classifier."}, {"start": 573.0, "text": "This model allows you to"}, {"start": 575.0, "text": "determine the most dominant"}, {"start": 576.0, "text": "sound within an audio stream."}, {"start": 580.0, "text": "Since audio data is time series"}, {"start": 581.0, "text": "based, you could differentiate"}, {"start": 583.0, "text": "between the start and end points"}, {"start": 585.0, "text": "of different sounds such as when"}, {"start": 586.0, "text": "the guitar solo ends and the"}, {"start": 588.0, "text": "crowd goes wild."}, {"start": 591.0, "text": "This model leverages transfer"}, {"start": 593.0, "text": "learning so you can also"}, {"start": 594.0, "text": "experience faster training"}, {"start": 595.0, "text": "times."}, {"start": 596.0, "text": "And we also understand that"}, {"start": 598.0, "text": "optimizing performance across"}, {"start": 600.0, "text": "complex applications is"}, {"start": 601.0, "text": "challenging."}, {"start": 602.0, "text": "Which is why we want to"}, {"start": 603.0, "text": "emphasize that these models are"}, {"start": 605.0, "text": "lightweight and run on the"}, {"start": 606.0, "text": "Neural Engine, making them ideal"}, {"start": 609.0, "text": "for real-time applications on"}, {"start": 611.0, "text": "any device."}, {"start": 612.0, "text": "Our third domain is Activity."}, {"start": 617.0, "text": "And within Activity, we have the"}, {"start": 619.0, "text": "Activity Classifier for the"}, {"start": 620.0, "text": "first time."}, {"start": 622.0, "text": "This model also operates on time"}, {"start": 625.0, "text": "series-based data. And Activity Classifiers can be"}, {"start": 628.0, "text": "trained to categorize contents"}, {"start": 630.0, "text": "of motion data from a variety of"}, {"start": 632.0, "text": "sensors such as the"}, {"start": 633.0, "text": "Accelerometer and Gyroscope."}, {"start": 637.0, "text": "These models are deep learning-based and train on the"}, {"start": 639.0, "text": "GPU."}, {"start": 640.0, "text": "And they result in small model"}, {"start": 642.0, "text": "sizes that are also ideal for"}, {"start": 643.0, "text": "deployment on any device."}, {"start": 647.0, "text": "Our second to last input is"}, {"start": 649.0, "text": "Text."}, {"start": 650.0, "text": "Within Text, there are two model"}, {"start": 652.0, "text": "types available; the Text"}, {"start": 654.0, "text": "Classifier and the Word Tagger."}, {"start": 658.0, "text": "Text classification can be used"}, {"start": 660.0, "text": "to label sentences, paragraphs,"}, {"start": 662.0, "text": "or even entire articles based on"}, {"start": 664.0, "text": "their contents."}, {"start": 665.0, "text": "You can train these for custom"}, {"start": 667.0, "text": "topic identification or"}, {"start": 668.0, "text": "categorization tasks."}, {"start": 671.0, "text": "In Create ML, there are a"}, {"start": 672.0, "text": "variety of different algorithms"}, {"start": 674.0, "text": "for you to try and even a new"}, {"start": 675.0, "text": "transfer learning option this"}, {"start": 677.0, "text": "year."}, {"start": 678.0, "text": "The Word Tagger is slightly more"}, {"start": 681.0, "text": "nuanced."}, {"start": 682.0, "text": "It's ideal for labeling tokens"}, {"start": 684.0, "text": "or words of interest in text."}, {"start": 687.0, "text": "General purpose examples of this"}, {"start": 688.0, "text": "are things like tagging"}, {"start": 690.0, "text": "different parts of speech or"}, {"start": 692.0, "text": "recognizing named entities,"}, {"start": 694.0, "text": "though you could customize your"}, {"start": 695.0, "text": "own to do things like tag"}, {"start": 697.0, "text": "cheeses."}, {"start": 698.0, "text": "With a Cheese Tagger, you could"}, {"start": 699.0, "text": "be sure to identify different"}, {"start": 701.0, "text": "flavor notes from any cheese"}, {"start": 703.0, "text": "description."}, {"start": 704.0, "text": "Our last domain is the most"}, {"start": 707.0, "text": "general of all five; Tabular"}, {"start": 709.0, "text": "Data."}, {"start": 711.0, "text": "And within this, we have three"}, {"start": 712.0, "text": "model types; the Tabular"}, {"start": 714.0, "text": "Classifier, Tabular Regressor,"}, {"start": 718.0, "text": "and Recommender."}, {"start": 719.0, "text": "Classifiers are for categorizing"}, {"start": 721.0, "text": "samples based on their features"}, {"start": 723.0, "text": "of interest."}, {"start": 724.0, "text": "And features can be a variety of"}, {"start": 726.0, "text": "different types such as"}, {"start": 727.0, "text": "integers, doubles, strings, so"}, {"start": 730.0, "text": "long as your target is a"}, {"start": 731.0, "text": "discrete value."}, {"start": 734.0, "text": "These allow you to do things"}, {"start": 735.0, "text": "like determine if a seat is"}, {"start": 737.0, "text": "comfortable or not based on a"}, {"start": 738.0, "text": "particular person's height and"}, {"start": 740.0, "text": "weight and specific properties"}, {"start": 742.0, "text": "of the seat such as the amount"}, {"start": 743.0, "text": "of leg room."}, {"start": 745.0, "text": "What's unique about the Tabular"}, {"start": 746.0, "text": "Classifier is it extracts away"}, {"start": 748.0, "text": "the underlying algorithm for"}, {"start": 750.0, "text": "you. And identifies the best multiple"}, {"start": 752.0, "text": "classifiers for your data."}, {"start": 755.0, "text": "If you instead want a model that"}, {"start": 757.0, "text": "will predict a numeric value,"}, {"start": 758.0, "text": "such as a rating or a score, you"}, {"start": 760.0, "text": "may instead want to use the"}, {"start": 762.0, "text": "Tabular Regressor."}, {"start": 764.0, "text": "This model quantifies samples"}, {"start": 766.0, "text": "based on their defining"}, {"start": 767.0, "text": "features. So, you could train one to"}, {"start": 769.0, "text": "estimate the price of a house"}, {"start": 771.0, "text": "based on its location and number"}, {"start": 772.0, "text": "of bedrooms, bathrooms, and"}, {"start": 774.0, "text": "parking spaces."}, {"start": 776.0, "text": "Like the Classifier, the"}, {"start": 777.0, "text": "Regressor also automatically"}, {"start": 779.0, "text": "detects the best of multiple"}, {"start": 781.0, "text": "regressors for your data."}, {"start": 783.0, "text": "Though, you still have the flexibility to choose a specific"}, {"start": 786.0, "text": "boosted or decision tree, random"}, {"start": 788.0, "text": "forest, or linear regressor, if"}, {"start": 790.0, "text": "you like."}, {"start": 792.0, "text": "And our last model is the"}, {"start": 794.0, "text": "Recommender which allows you to"}, {"start": 796.0, "text": "recommend content based on user"}, {"start": 797.0, "text": "behavior."}, {"start": 799.0, "text": "The Recommender can be trained"}, {"start": 800.0, "text": "on user-item interactions with"}, {"start": 803.0, "text": "or without ratings."}, {"start": 804.0, "text": "And it's able to be deployed on"}, {"start": 806.0, "text": "device, saving you the hassle of"}, {"start": 808.0, "text": "setting up the server."}, {"start": 811.0, "text": "As we saw, Create ML comes with"}, {"start": 813.0, "text": "great features to help you set"}, {"start": 815.0, "text": "up your machine learning"}, {"start": 816.0, "text": "experiments, use native support"}, {"start": 818.0, "text": "for data visualization, metrics,"}, {"start": 820.0, "text": "and performance."}, {"start": 822.0, "text": "And the machine learning models"}, {"start": 823.0, "text": "you train can easily be saved"}, {"start": 825.0, "text": "and shared with members of your"}, {"start": 827.0, "text": "team."}, {"start": 828.0, "text": "Of course, all of this leverages"}, {"start": 830.0, "text": "the power and efficiency of"}, {"start": 832.0, "text": "training on your Mac."}, {"start": 835.0, "text": "This new medium augments other"}, {"start": 836.0, "text": "ways you have available to you"}, {"start": 838.0, "text": "to create machine learning"}, {"start": 839.0, "text": "models such as in Swift"}, {"start": 841.0, "text": "Playgrounds, Swift Scripts, or"}, {"start": 843.0, "text": "Swift Frepple , Xcode"}, {"start": 844.0, "text": "Playground."}, {"start": 845.0, "text": "But allows you to do so without"}, {"start": 847.0, "text": "writing a single line of code."}, {"start": 850.0, "text": "We believe this brings machine"}, {"start": 852.0, "text": "learning to everyone."}, {"start": 855.0, "text": "To summarize, in Create ML this"}, {"start": 857.0, "text": "year, you have new models, nine"}, {"start": 859.0, "text": "templates, and a whole new"}]}
